<title>SWEDEN: Volvo 9 mo operating profit by division.</title>
<headline>Volvo 9 mo operating profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle manufacturer reports operating profit by division for the nine months to September 30, 1996, compared with the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>(Millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Volvo Car				 573   vs  1,930</p>
<p>  Volvo Truck			     413   vs  4,025</p>
<p>  Volvo Bus				 155   vs    282</p>
<p>  Volvo Construction Equipment	928   vs    313</p>
<p>  Volvo Penta				63   vs    197</p>
<p>  Volvo Aero				110   vs     97</p>
<p>  Group eliminations, other  CHARGE  82   VS     63  CREDIT</p>
<p>  Total vehicle operations	  2,160   vs  6,907</p>
<p>  Volvo group total		   2,324   vs  8,081</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
